WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.850
<b>World History</b>

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:13.130
Maybe I shouldn't have done that.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.790
That isn't true...

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:19.770
Thanks to you, I decided to face it,
 rather than run away.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:20.800
Really?

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.050
Really!

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.370
Thanks, Miku.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:27.410
Sure.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.640
Okay, I'll be going!

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.870
You go home without me!

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:31.630
<b>Episode 8 
The Courage to Face It</b>

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:44.130
Remember when they thought the Moon 
would crash into Earth a while ago?

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:48.480
The girl they showed on the news

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.530
looked a lot like you...

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.190
Ever since, I've been thinking about you,

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.770
hoping we could start over.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:57.960
Start over...

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:00.780
I know it's selfish.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:01.910
<b>What Caused the Disaster?        Surviving Families Rage</b>

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:05.830
But I couldn't handle all that stuff!

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.450
<b>Murderer                                      Thief</b>

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.450
<b>You were the only survivor!</b>

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:09.250
So, let's be together again.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.310
Would you tell Mom about me?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.480
I can't...

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:19.520
You were the one who vanished 
when we wanted you most.

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:23.680
Guess it was asking too much, huh?

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.600
I thought it might work out somehow.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.720
It's been long enough, right?

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.890
Do you remember, Hibiki,

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:36.060
when you were little, the magic 
words I taught you to get by,

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:37.730
when things seem impossible?

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.520
Wait, Hibiki!

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.490
At the moment, I don't have the money on me...

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:27.780
It seems you got it the boring way in Tsukuba.

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:30.140
I could have stolen it by force,

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:33.790
but if they'd destroyed it to foil me, 
that would have been the end.

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:38.500
Each one is like a blood vessel, 
spreading across the Earth.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.960
Once, Dr. Nastassja used these lines

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.050
to gather phonic gain at Frontier.

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:48.260
This is the ley line map.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:51.220
The scalpels we need to dissect the world

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.520
are gathering here, at the Château de Tiffauges.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.630
Even without them,

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.950
our little sister says she hasn't

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:00.700
destroyed enough things yet.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.030
With the values we saw this morning,

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:07.950
we might be able to use the Ignite Module!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:10.930
Now...

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:15.060
All we need is the strength 
to resist Dáinsleif's curse.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:17.120
Hey, Kiri-chan...

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.290
This one!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:24.470
I chose the bitter coffee!

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:28.330
If you don't want to burden others,

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.190
what do you have to do?

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:35.050
I'm sure you need a strong will,

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:37.190
so you don't regret your choices...

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:38.630
Here.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:44.240
I'm fine with black coffee.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.560
Th-Thanks.

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:51.630
We've detected Alca-Noise.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:56.340
Sixty-eight meters underground. 
Down in the utility conduits!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.120
Utility conduits?

00:05:58.390 --> 00:05:59.960
What are those?

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:04.380
Underground tunnels that house energy 
conduits, such as power cables.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:07.300
You should see an entrance nearby.

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:09.640
That's...

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:12.530
HQ is on its way.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.680
We've sent Tachibana there already.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.250
It's an emergency,

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.680
but don't jump in until the dummy gets there!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.090
It's okay. Everything's just fine.

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.110
It's okay... Everything's just fine.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.150
It's okay... Everything's just fine...

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.500
Over here!

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.360
Did something happen?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.370
Nothing.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:37.710
That isn't the way it looks.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:40.220
It doesn't have anything to do with you!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:42.710
It's true...

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:46.450
Maybe we can't help.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:48.720
But even so...

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.910
I'm sorry... I wasn't thinking.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.150
<i>It may be that only simple problems</i>

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:00.350
<i>can be solved with your fists.</i>

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.880
<i>So... I'll finish this fast!</i>

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.660
Let's go, you two!

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:14.450
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:51.850
<i>A right hand, resolved to break through,</i>

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:57.940
<i>as the sound that I am resounds.</i>

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.560
You're here.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:08:00.540
But I don't have time to fight you today—

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:03.510
<i>The courage to carry you beyond how or why,</i>

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:08.300
<i>clutched in an unwavering fist.</i>

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.380
You didn't let me finish!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.870
<i>Be brave! Let's shout!</i>

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.560
<i>Just keep moving forward.</i>

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.960
She's crying?

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:19.490
<i>You're the type to give it everything you've got.</i>

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.270
Something's really wrong!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:22.570
<i>Break through the walls, 
break through with my heart.</i>

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:24.980
<i>As long as there's a song in my heart...</i>

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:28.820
<i>How can he say he wants to start 
over, like it's that easy?</i>

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.770
You were the one who ruined it, Dad!

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:31.900
You were the one!

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:33.240
She's going too deep!

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:38.530
It was you, Dad!

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:39.740
<i>No...</i>

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:43.550
<i>I ruined it, too...</i>

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.210
I'm disappointed.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.210
You should have listened!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.470
Are you all right?

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:57.240
You aren't going to sing?

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.210
If you don't,

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:02.220
you'll die!

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.000
Kiri-chan...

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.540
Are you okay?

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:33.550
Of course I'm not...

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:38.070
Of course I'm not okay!

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:41.180
<i>The girls I was supposed to protect 
protected me instead.</i>

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.430
<i>Of course I'm not okay!</i>

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.690
I'll have to use the Ignite Module...

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:48.770
No!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.760
Are you doing that because I'm a burden?

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.030
Wasting time isn't good.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.400
You may be right, but...

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.700
They piss me off!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.020
I'm leaving.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.520
So sing next time!

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.720
Wait...

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.290
Kiri-chan...

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.260
We got here as fast as we could, but...

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:25.920
If we aren't in time, that's irrelevant.

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.520
What were the dolls planning?

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.650
All the major damage came

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.830
from Hibiki-san and the others' attacks.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:36.750
What's this?

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:41.280
The Autoscorers were after... No way!

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.810
Contact the commander at once!

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:44.490
Yes, sir!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.500
The exam

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.560
revealed no major injuries.

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:56.190
But you need to stay put.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.010
I'm glad...

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:58.440
Yeah.

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:00.060
This is all Shirabe's fault!

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:02.850
It's because you pushed yourself too hard.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:05.890
It's because you jumped in without thinking!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:10.020
It's because you think I'm a burden!

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:12.580
I can't believe those two are fighting.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:16.440
It'll exacerbate your injuries. Please stop.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.350
In this type of mental state,

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:21.120
you can't control the Ignite Modules!

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.090
I'm sorry, you two...

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:32.990
I was the one who first screwed things up.

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:37.180
What happened back there?

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:38.010
Yeah.

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:43.010
I saw my dad again...

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.400
In my memories from long ago,

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:48.820
he was kind and pretty great.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:51.930
But I saw a really bad side of him.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.810
A bad side?

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:57.720
He didn't understand what he'd done.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:00.320
He was so irresponsible and awful.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:02.280
I didn't want to see that.

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.320
If I'd known I'd feel this way,

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.830
I wouldn't have wanted to see him again...

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.080
It's my fault... I...

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.680
No, it isn't your fault, Miku.

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:14.080
It's my dad's fault.

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:15.450
But...

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.590
It's okay. Everything's just fine.

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:23.590
So don't cry, Miku.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.860
I'm giving this to both of you.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.610
Model K?

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.950
The Autoscorers are likely to attack again.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:48.730
When using it, be very careful.

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:51.180
Not only does it strain your body,

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:55.120
we have a finite amount of LiNKER left.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.800
So it was about her dad, after all.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:03.010
At a time like this, 
what are you supposed to do?

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:07.010
I don't know what to do, either.

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:10.480
I've spent my whole life without knowing

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.700
what a normal family's like.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:17.450
The enemy's objective was
 to look at the power conduits?

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:18.400
Yes.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.700
With the amount of electricity down

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.200
after the destruction of the power plants,

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:27.050
power is being priority routed 
to government facilities.

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:28.660
By following it...

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:33.660
They'll be able to find entrances that 
can't be seen above ground.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.430
How about this?

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.730
You stole it in quite a flashy manner.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.060
Where are you going, Micha?

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:56.810
The memory installation will soon finish.

00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:59.670
I know my own mission!

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.460
I'll make sure it happens.

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:03.820
The rest of the time, let me do what I want.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.830
Don't you have something you want to say to me?

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.000
You're the one who wants 
to say something, Shirabe!

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:20.540
I...

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:27.790
What's this?

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.430
She's trying to get us to fight!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:45.230
If you think we're just a burden...

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:54.830
<i>Fallian Shul Shagana tron.</i>

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:30.740
<i>A twin-tailed rondo.</i>

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.640
<i>Your punishment's about to begin,</i>

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.070
<b>Type Alpha 100 Samsara</b>

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:39.660
<i>initializing the justice that will rip you apart.</i>

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.290
I'm sending reinforcements!

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:40.580
Just hang in there—

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:45.870
<i>Antagonism crashing into an unripe heart,</i>

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:49.060
<i>voltage with nowhere to go,</i>

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:50.380
A giant shadow on the ocean floor?

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.550
<i>and hidden tears.</i>

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.890
My little sister and I will lend 
you some non-flashy support.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:55.240
<i>The words of a hypocrite,</i>

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:57.750
<i>torn apart.</i>

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:58.310
So have your fun, Micha.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:01.190
<i>Let's kiss and dream of a world</i>

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:03.760
<i>that we'll never cut apart!</i>

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.190
Type Delta Bewitching Axle

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:06.620
<i>I want to be strong.</i>

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:10.420
<i>If I rely on others to protect me,</i>

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:16.190
<i>I'll never fulfill the dream in my heart.</i>

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.530
Is that all?

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:16.490
You were actually stronger before 
you enhanced your Gears.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:18.870
<i>If I become strong...</i>

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:19.510
That isn't true!

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:19.910
No!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.500
<b>K1LL JUL1ET</b>

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.640
Gotcha!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:33.210
Nope, I got you!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.140
You guys can't do it unless you work together.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.470
If I can't dodge,

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:42.530
I'll block!

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:51.690
Why do you jump in to protect me
 without thinking?!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.950
Then, I really am in the way?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.950
No! It's because I love you!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.290
I love you,

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:04.620
so I couldn't bear to see you hurt!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.960
Then... I...

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.210
I starting thinking that way

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:12.630
when you protected me.

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.300
Of course I'm not okay!

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.490
Everyone gets mad at us

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:19.680
because they really care about us!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.460
They're all kind people

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:25.190
who care about us...

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.190
You can't defeat me by screwing around!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:35.190
I don't want my life to end so horribly,

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:37.570
in the world that Mama left us!

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:40.530
He was so irresponsible and awful.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.460
Then we'll just have to be great!

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:47.790
The strength to face what we've done...

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:49.840
<i>Ignite Module!</i>

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:51.260
<i>Drawn Blade!</i>

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:51.800
Death!

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.550
Dáinsleif...

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:14.570
A power without limit, growing ever stronger!

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:19.160
I'm sorry, Kiri-chan...

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.520
It's all right.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.510
For now, we need to...

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:26.340
That's right... We need to 
apologize to everyone.

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:29.330
And for that, we need to be strong!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.900
<i>Danger signals flashing.</i>

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:45.980
<i>Hell or Heaven, which do ya want? Death!</i>

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:46.600
Shirabe!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.990
I'm the strongest! You can't hurt me!

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:51.660
Sing more strongly! More violently!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:58.240
<i>Antagonism crashing into an unripe heart,</i>

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:01.320
<i>voltage with nowhere to go,</i>

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.740
<i>and hidden tears.</i>

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:10.430
<i>These rails just go forward, right? Death!</i>

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.170
Face it...

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.620
Or you won't be able to overcome it!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:13.500
<i>Let's kiss and dream of a world</i>

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:16.180
<i>that we'll never cut apart!</i>

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:19.220
<i>I want to be strong.</i>

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:22.550
<i>If I rely on others to protect me,</i>

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.640
If you just keep running, you'll lose.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:28.600
<i>I'll never fulfill the dream in my heart.</i>

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:25.720
I know!

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.350
That's why...

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.350
Your weapon won't work.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:32.100
<i>Holding the courage to be strong in your heart,</i>

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:35.140
<i>as a light envelops the Moon.</i>

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:38.070
<i>I want to shine down on you...</i>

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:41.070
They aren't strong enough alone, 
so they're working together?

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.070
<b>ZABaBA ECl1PS3 
Forbidden Wheel of Evil</b>

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:43.200
<i>Just loving!</i>

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.340
Do you know how much we worried?!

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:58.210
For once, why not try following orders?

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.970
We shouldn't have gone on our own.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.220
We'll be careful in the future.

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.470
It's rare for you to give in...

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:11.690
All we can do without straining ourselves 
is to accept things as they are.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.980
So we're sorry.

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.000
If you understand, that's fine...

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:21.290
Jeez.

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.590
They've grown up

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.020
without my help.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:29.380
<i>They aren't like I am...</i>

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:35.130
Not being a burden is more

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.700
than merely getting strong.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.510
It's taking responsibility for your actions.

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.390
Responsibility...

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.470
Honoring your obligations.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.360
But if I say that's being "good,"

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:51.520
is that the hypocrisy you hate?

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:53.230
That's hypocrisy.

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:57.750
I always wanted to apologize for hurting Hibiki-san

00:20:57.750 --> 00:21:00.400
with my thoughtless words.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.020
You aren't the only one who needs

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:07.320
the courage to say she's sorry.

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:10.330
It's my job to protect you!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.170
Kiri-chan...

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:14.830
Thank you.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:18.160
Whenever I say that, it's always the truth.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.860
So you've awakened?

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:41.690
I see...

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.280
Garie and Micha are gone?

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:46.710
They died in a very flashy way.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.700
What will you do now?

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.560
What else?

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:54.200
I will complete the Apocalypse of All Things.

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:57.470
My wish, for centuries, has been

00:21:57.470 --> 00:21:59.710
to kill all the miracles.

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:04.520
Did you hear?

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:07.110
Shirabe-chan and Kirika-chan are strong, right?

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:09.350
I really think they've gotten stronger.

00:22:09.770 --> 00:22:12.220
Don't you, Elfnein-chan?

00:22:12.950 --> 00:22:15.760
Yes... I do.

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:19.730
And that will hasten the end of the world!
